I need a break.
I am standing in the kitchen.
My bag is lying on the floor.
I have a thermos in the bag.
I take the thermos.
The coffee is still warm.
I pour the coffee into a cup.
The cup is standing on the table.
I take a sip.
Then I go to the window.
The window is very tall.
I look outside.
There is the courtyard.
The courtyard is quiet.
A tree is standing in the courtyard.
It is winter and the tree is bare.
I take a deep breath.
I am very relieved.
This is finally my flat.
